@baseUrl=http://localhost:8080

### Try to find all tournament
GET {{baseUrl}}/tournaments/all

### Try to find on tournament
GET {{baseUrl}}/tournaments/id/1

### Try to create a tournament
POST {{baseUrl}}/tournaments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nom": "super tournois",
  "description": "c'est comme un tournois mais c'est un super tournois",
  "date_debut": "2026-03-09",
  "date_fin": "2026-04-09",
  "date_fin_inscription": "2026-03-12",
  "nbrTeam": 16,
  "etat": "SAUVEGARDE"
}

### Try to create a tournament
POST {{baseUrl}}/tournaments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nom": "super tournois",
  "description": "c'est comme un tournois mais c'est un super tournois",
  "date_debut": "2026-03-09",
  "date_fin": "2026-04-09",
  "date_fin_inscription": "2026-03-12",
  "nbrTeam": 16,
  "gagnant": {
    "id": 1
  }
}
### Try to update the status of a tournament to INSCRIPTION_OUVERTE
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/tournaments/publish/1


### Cases of errors

### Try to find on tournament with a letter instead of a number (error 400)
GET {{baseUrl}}/tournaments/id/z

### Try to find on tournament with an ID that does not exist (error 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/tournaments/id/50

## POST avec cas d'erreur à tester (les post actuelle renvoie des 403)

### Try to update the status of a tournament to INSCRIPTION_OUVERTE with a letter instead an id (error 400)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/tournaments/publish/e

### Try to update the status of a tournament to INSCRIPTION_OUVERTE with an ID that does not exist (error 404)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/tournaments/publish/50

### Try to update the status of a tournament to INSCRIPTION_OUVERTE with an ID that does not exist (error 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/tournaments/user/4
